{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"submission\":\"update.json\",\"summary\":\"Requested execution that extends the former-voter refutation to a live removal. The remaining voters apply a real RemoveNode for node 3, a read is queued at the leader, and the confirming heartbeat response is delivered first from the removed node and then from a current voter, with the reply count after each delivery as the endpoint. Local construction runs showed zero replies after the removed node's response and one after the voter's, so a delayed response from a removed voter does not satisfy the ReadIndex quorum once the removal is applied. Validation reports valid with execution_requested and one experiment create; recording the resulting fact and revised limitation awaits the receipt.\"}"}}
